{"t": 1794110497.7304692, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix.\n\n**Production error:** Sentry `CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q` \u2014 `PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist` (2,940 events, os=Android 15, app=android 8.2). The Android keyboard adds surrounding/inner spaces and lower-cases input, so valid codes were sent to lookup unnormalised.\n\n**Change:** implemented `checkout.promo.normalize_code` to strip surrounding whitespace, remove inner spaces and upper-case the code before lookup.\n\n```python\ndef normalize_code(code: str) -> str:\n    return \"\".join(code.split()).upper()\n```\n\nVerified locally: `' autumn24 '`, `' AUTUMN 24 '` and `'Autumn24\\n'` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`.\n\nFile changed: `checkout/promo.py`", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
